          "text": "Left temple lesion history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Lesion present for approximately 9–12 months, slowly increasing in size, with occasional crusting or bleeding when shaving."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left temple lesion examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 8–9 mm pearly papule with rolled edge, telangiectasia, and small central crust; no obvious ulceration or surrounding induration."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Post-biopsy symptoms and lesion change"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Since the punch biopsy, the site has settled; patient reports no increased pain and no change."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Other skin lesions"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports having many spots from years on a farm and asks whether they could all be cancer; no other specific lesions reported today. No obvious other suspicious lesions on quick examination of face, scalp, and forearms."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lymph node examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No palpable preauricular, postauricular, or cervical nodes."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cranial nerve VII examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Cranial nerve VII grossly intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No weight loss, night sweats, or neurological symptoms; no facial weakness or numbness."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left temple skin punch biopsy result"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nodular basal cell carcinoma, extending to one lateral margin; no morphoeic or infiltrative features and no perineural invasion."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Concern about cancer"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient expressed marked worry, including concern that the tumour could spread to the brain or bones, and asked whether a full-body scan or blood tests were needed."
      }
